// House Of The Rising Sun (Based on The Animals 1964)

Tempo 80
Keysig F

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Groove BlueFolkIntro

Swell mp mf 4

// Good example here. Not quite the same as the Animals intro but
// for computer generated it's not bad. Esp. since we're using a
// stock MMA library. We turn off the chords and reduce the walk
// volume, fiddle a bit with the Arpeggio settings ... and we're done

Chord Volume Off
Walk  Volume 40%
Begin Arpeggio
   Articulate 60
   Harmony 2Below
   HarmonyVolume  80
   // This sequence is the same as the sheet music:
   //   triplet {8 rest, 16, 16, 8 } ... repeat
   // set up here in 4 lines so you can see the triplets

   Sequence {1.33 4 100;  1.45 8 70; 1.66 8 50;
             2    4 100;  2.33 8 70; 2.66 8 50;
             3.33 4 100;  3.45 8 70; 3.66 8 50;
             4    4 100;  4.33 8 70; 4.66 8 50; }
End

1        Dm    /      F
2         G     /     Bb
3        Dm       /     A7
4        Dm       /     A7

AllGrooves Arpeggio Volume p

Repeat
Groove BlueFolk2
Volume m

5        Dm      /      F
6         G      /     Bb
7        Dm      /      F
8        A7

Groove BlueFolk2Plus
Volume mf

9        Dm      /      F
10        G      /     Bb
11       Dm      /     A7
12       Dm      /      F

Groove BlueFolk2
Volume m

13       Dm      /      F
14        G      /     Bb
15       Dm      /      F
16       A7

Groove BlueFolk2Plus
Decresc mp 4

17       Dm      /      F
18        G      /     Bb
19       Dm      /     A7
20       Dm      /      F

Groove BlueFolk2Sus
Cresc mf 4

21       Dm      /      F
22        G      /     Bb
23       Dm      /      F
24       A7

Groove BlueFolk2SusPlus
Decresc mp 2

25       Dm      /      F
26        G      /     Bb

RepeatEnding

27       Dm      /     A7
Groove BlueFolkIntro
Seq 4

28       Dm      /      F

RepeatEnd
Groove BlueFolkEnd
Decresc ppp 2

27       Dm      /     A7
29       Dm  z!

